{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26947","headline":"和李十二舍人裴四二舍人两阁老酬白少傅见寄 · 姚合","name":"和李十二舍人裴四二舍人两阁老酬白少傅见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢草王言星岁久，嵩高山色日相亲。\n萧条雨夜吟连晓，撩乱花时看尽春。\n此世逍遥应独得，古来闲散有谁邻。\n林中长老呼居士，天下书生仰达人。\n酒挈数瓶杯亦阔，诗成千首语皆新。\n纶闱竝命诚宜贺，不念衰年寄上频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}